00:10:03,083 --> 00:10:05,674
and its annual report calls pay its

292
00:10:05,674 --> 00:10:07,976
largest expense after the goods

293
00:10:07,976 --> 00:10:09,440
themselves.

294
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,606
It employed about three hundred and

295
00:10:11,606 --> 00:10:13,879
fifty-five thousand people worldwide at

296
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:16,752
the end of fiscal twenty twenty-six.

297
00:10:17,017 --> 00:10:18,907
And the shareholders?

298
00:10:18,907 --> 00:10:20,077
On November tenth,

299
00:10:20,077 --> 00:10:21,247
twenty twenty-six,

300
00:10:21,247 --> 00:10:23,627
Costco declared a special dividend of

301
00:10:23,627 --> 00:10:25,417
thirty dollars a share.

302
00:10:25,537 --> 00:10:27,799
About thirteen point three billion dollars

303
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:29,077
