304
00:10:29,217 --> 00:10:30,884
By our calculation,

305
00:10:30,884 --> 00:10:33,058
that's more than two years of membership

306
00:10:33,058 --> 00:10:33,517
fees,

307
00:10:33,517 --> 00:10:35,325
