318
00:10:56,350 --> 00:10:58,740
Let me put the machine together.

319
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:01,260
Low prices bring members in.

320
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:02,392
Members pay fees,

321
00:11:02,392 --> 00:11:05,570
