324
00:11:10,490 --> 00:11:13,332
Fast sales let Costco hold its suppliers'

325
00:11:13,332 --> 00:11:14,500
money.

326
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:16,584
And the hot dog keeps you coming

327
00:11:16,584 --> 00:11:17,440
