336
00:11:34,257 --> 00:11:36,077
The store is the bait.

337
00:11:36,077 --> 00:11:38,037
The fee is the catch.

338
00:11:38,257 --> 00:11:40,367
And the dollar-fifty hot dog?

339
00:11:40,397 --> 00:11:41,833
That's the reminder,

340
00:11:41,833 --> 00:11:43,756
